t(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e605fe81-8ae9-5f81-9f29-4e2e03aeb1d5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e605fe81-8ae9-5f81-9f29-4e2e03aeb1d5" :question/answer-fields "27242213-0e71-5441-a4e6-60da76f03e74"] [:db/ensure "e605fe81-8ae9-5f81-9f29-4e2e03aeb1d5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "e605fe81-8ae9-5f81-9f29-4e2e03aeb1d5"] [:db/add "98ff7521-9b92-5d64-b06a-55c0e295428a" :answer/id #uuid "98ff7521-9b92-5d64-b06a-55c0e295428a"] [:db/add "98ff7521-9b92-5d64-b06a-55c0e295428a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "98ff7521-9b92-5d64-b06a-55c0e295428a" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\sec{\\left(x^{3} + 1 \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "98ff7521-9b92-5d64-b06a-55c0e295428a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "986e7511-ec1f-5964-b4fd-b65744ea5ed3" :answer/id #uuid "986e7511-ec1f-5964-b4fd-b65744ea5ed3"] [:db/add "986e7511-ec1f-5964-b4fd-b65744ea5ed3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "986e7511-ec1f-5964-b4fd-b65744ea5ed3" :answer/value "- \\frac{4 \\sec{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "986e7511-ec1f-5964-b4fd-b65744ea5ed3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4d477e28-646c-5281-8fcc-6c2be444bac3" :answer/id #uuid "4d477e28-646c-5281-8fcc-6c2be444bac3"] [:db/add "4d477e28-646c-5281-8fcc-6c2be444bac3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4d477e28-646c-5281-8fcc-6c2be444bac3" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\sec{\\left(\\frac{x^{3}}{2} \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "4d477e28-646c-5281-8fcc-6c2be444bac3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "63f25881-951f-5d3d-a9b6-83689776cbe5" :answer/id #uuid "63f25881-951f-5d3d-a9b6-83