an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "e311139a-9e29-5471-bf3a-243aed01977f" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 x^{2} \\tan{\\left(x^{3} \\right)} \\sec{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\sec{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e311139a-9e29-5471-bf3a-243aed01977f" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "e311139a-9e29-5471-bf3a-243aed01977f" :question/answer-fields "efc8f1de-5cfd-50f8-a0bf-92425fe62faa"] [:db/ensure "e311139a-9e29-5471-bf3a-243aed01977f" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068917 :knowledge-point/questions "e311139a-9e29-5471-bf3a-243aed01977f"] [:db/add "e4f57ae7-a955-57c2-a0cb-9151822c7800" :answer/id #uuid "e4f57ae7-a955-57c2-a0cb-9151822c7800"] [:db/add "e4f57ae7-a955-57c2-a0cb-9151822c7800" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e4f57ae7-a955-57c2-a0cb-9151822c7800" :answer/value "\\frac{4 \\csc{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "e4f57ae7-a955-57c2-a0cb-9151822c7800" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e607b06d-3ba0-5bfd-ac67-d2b745f8168b" :answer/id #uuid "e607b06d-3ba0-5bfd-ac67-d2b745f8168b"] [:db/add "e607b06d-3ba0-5bfd-ac67-d2b745f8168b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e607b06d-3ba0-5bfd-ac67-d2b745f8168b" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\csc{\\left(x^{3} \\right)}}{3}+C"] [:db/ensure "e607b06d-3ba0-5bfd-ac67-d2b745f8168b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1d0ded6c-712a-51d5-8d98-9c8d947e7983" :ans